{"verse_key": "10:99", "surah": 10, "verse": 99, "text_uthmani": "وَلَوْ شَآءَ رَبُّكَ لَـَٔامَنَ مَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ كُلُّهُمْ جَمِيعًا ۚ أَفَأَنتَ تُكْرِهُ ٱلنَّاسَ حَتَّىٰ يَكُونُوا۟ مُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "And had your Lord willed, those on earth would have believed - all of them entirely. Then, [O Muḥammad], would you compel the people in order that they become believers?", "verse_from_ms": 2133530, "verse_to_ms": 2152760, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَلَوْ", "start_ms": 2133530, "end_ms": 2134410}, {"i": 1, "text": "شَآءَ", "start_ms": 2134410, "end_ms": 2135790}, {"i": 2, "text": "رَبُّكَ", "start_ms": 2135790, "end_ms": 2137780}, {"i": 3, "text": "لَـَٔامَنَ", "start_ms": 2137780, "end_ms": 2138520}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 2138520, "end_ms": 2139570}, {"i": 5, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 2139570, "end_ms": 2140290}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 2140290, "end_ms": 2140570}, {"i": 7, "text": "كُلُّهُمْ", "start_ms": 2140570, "end_ms": 2141270}, {"i": 8, "text": "جَمِيعًا", "start_ms": 2141270, "end_ms": 2142290}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2142290, "end_ms": 2144130}, {"i": 10, "text": "أَفَأَنتَ", "start_ms": 2144130, "end_ms": 2145800}, {"i": 11, "text": "تُكْرِهُ", "start_ms": 2145800, "end_ms": 2146640}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "start_ms": 2146640, "end_ms": 2147740}, {"i": 13, "text": "حَتَّىٰ", "start_ms": 2147740, "end_ms": 2148540}, {"i": 14, "text": "يَكُونُوا۟", "start_ms": 2148540, "end_ms": 2149590}, {"i": 15, "text": "مُؤْمِنِينَ", "start_ms": 2149590, "end_ms": 2152305}]}